<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have seized a major town in eastern DRC, breaking a ceasefire and intensifying clashes with the Congolese army. ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri province while an ISIL affiliate sustains itself through conflict gold. A drone strike hit Bunyakiri hospital, forcing MSF to move 76 patients, and a Chinese national was abducted with two people killed in an ambush at Kalemie. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQalNDTWJMNEp2WUNCLXdEUm9hWG0yY2F2b3VNLUVLY2xWLVVMYVl6SHhwcU91ZkUwSThMTUItcElRZEZMaVF2blFZcEc0NE40eUdRWFdyTHRNejE3OGxXQ2U1eFljLUx2cXRqNFpLWFZIV2VKblpjMVdWTldWZzJlSmpfZEVoZFcwQ1ZodjJraEV0a0Zfa0paUG52S2JiMGtqNWJCbUZfTG5hdTZSR2pF?oc=5&quot;&gt;SSBCrack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE9BYlBQUjF6a0ZrMTBrSjNvTGlPcHZCd2RTSTB5NS1iMHhDTkpJUTVER1o1MmZFWWlsRnV2U1lhamFkek04bGNNUHhKaFpUU3RwQWJmblFOOFIya3FsdjNRcXlBQ01EUdIBXkFVX3lxTE05N0tCOU9SNkV1Z1NyZkZJZ3BaM0I2dm9sMzZRNXRWT19JMllzYnp1NktkRXpfNHVQcndUTlJjdmNyUlpxZU5rRG43cl91cTZPUG5lYUhHZldmWEpzM0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE5OSTFmSXJCWVVnSWRpUjlpZ3JQS2g0MXpKRi1MY3NmMTlkemlvdkpObGxQa1VRcmJJaFd3SmE1MUw0bl9HUHc3T0wzVEs0cEtuZzIxZFpGNmgyZHJONUhmS1RrOWdvM0FVTmFwMTdtT3VCQm1DeWpz?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQSks5aHI1dnR4am5Sa21VSERZV2Fnek1KbkRjWl81LU1pbENJeXZ0RUU4ejdNZUl1MlpFQU9Jdy1vRG5Xc2pDWFdfeF96eXkyYzRMOUpHNU8zcHducTczeHl2YzdKM2h4c3JzdzhNWmlSN2dBbDZaajVIX2FBUDE3aHZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Az